teach_text = "When someones accuses someone else of lying, they must have opposite roles."
bottom_out_text = "B1 and C1 accuse each other, so they have opposite roles. This means C2 has to tell the truth. A1 accuses B2, so they also have opposite roles. B3 and C3's statements cannot both be true, so at least one of them lies. We now know 1 liar, and 3 sets of two people that have to contain a liar. This means A2 and A3 have to tell the truth as there are no more liars. This implies that A1 and B1 lie. C3's statement can no longer be true, so it is the last liar."

